# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): a reader listens, and each page, knob, help card and button is said
# once, in the screen's own text (the words file says it in full); each new loop is said as it starts recording
wait 12000
listen
wait 100
said Tape page: Decay 4 minutes, Length 6 seconds, Layers 2, Wow 40. Preset Cassette, D Ionian, tape running. Battery full
listen
where
said Loop 1
tap ENV
wait 300
said Tone page: Stock Cassette, Tone 55, Hiss 40, Space 45
spin K1 1
wait 300
said Stock Reel
spin K1 -1
tap GLO
wait 300
said Setup page: Root D, Mode Ionian, Tune 0, Lights On
spin K4 1
wait 300
said Lights Keys
tap HOME
wait 300
spin K1 60
wait 300
said Decay 39 seconds
tap REC
wait 1000
said Recording loop 2: 
tap EDIT
wait 100
said HOLD ON
tap PLAY
wait 100
said TAPE STOPPED
tap PLAY
spin PRESET 1
wait 200
said PRESET Reel to Reel, F Ionian
press ARP
wait 1200
said ARP button. THE PHRASE. VOICE, PHRASE, DENSITY, OCTAVE
release ARP
tap OCT+
wait 100
said KEYS OCTAVE +1
